[CHANGE] benchmark_2/parts/dag_engine/tests/dag_engine_impl_test.py: Authored the full contract test suite for dag_engine_impl: DAG (node/edge registration, removal, lookup errors, validation for missing dependencies and cycles, topological ordering and tie-breaking, roots/leaves, critical path), WaveScheduler (next_wave ready ordering and empty case, mark_running, mark_succeeded dependent promotion requiring all upstreams, mark_failed FAIL_FAST/SKIP_DOWNSTREAM/CONTINUE_ON_ERROR, is_finished empty and terminal tracking, get_state/get_all_states), and DAGRunner (consolidated report, concurrent barrier execution, retry recovery, failure-policy accounting, timeout propagation, cycle/missing-dependency propagation, cancel/is_cancelled). All tests resolve singletons inside isolated enter_phase scopes backed by a fresh LifecycleRegistry.
[CHANGE] benchmark_2/parts/dag_engine/lib/dag_engine.py: Implement DAG interface module: data types, exceptions with message __str__, NodeState/FailurePolicy enums, and DAG/WaveScheduler/DAGRunner protocols with package-qualified imports and frozen value dataclasses.
[CHANGE] benchmark_2/parts/dag_engine/lib/dag_engine_impl.py: Implement DAG/WaveScheduler/DAGRunner singletons: adjacency graph with RLock, deterministic topological sort and critical path DP, wave scheduling with failure policies, and threaded runner with retries, per-node/overall timeouts, cancellation, and consolidated DAGRunReport.
